  "what_it_is": "The Zevo is an Anterior cervical plate fixation system by Medtronic that utilizes a locking screw system with a high angle at the superior and inferior ends designed to minimize plate extension to decrease risk of adjacent segment disease. If features a 35 degree angulation at the superior and inferior screw holes.\n\nFeatures:\n- 1 to 5 level plates\n- 1.9mm thick for 1-3 level plates\n- 2.1mm thick for 4 and 5 level\n- Rotational screw lock\n- Lengths:\n- 1 level: 15-29mm\n- 2 level: 27-51mm\n- 3 level: 43-71mm\n- 4 level: 65-89mm\n- 5 level: 77-108mm",
